      "title": "pcapng: put some defines outside the HAVE_PLUGINS ifdef.",
      "message": "pcapng: put some defines outside the HAVE_PLUGINS ifdef.\n\nThe define BT_INDEX_SHB is used in pcap_process_unhandled_option,\ncalled outside the HAVE_PLUGINS block. This causes a compile failure\nwith ENABLE_PLUGINS=off.\n",
